7109 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Introduction  \133\1762 minutes\135\n\nHi\054 my name is \137\137\137\137\056 Thank you for joining us today\056 We are grateful for your participation\056 We are working on a class project researching parents who plan to re\055enter\054 or have re\055entered\054 the workforce after taking a caregiving career break\056 We have prepared a 35\055minute interview with 10 short questions\056\nBefore we get started\054 would you mind if we record our session so we can reference it later\077 If you need to take a break at any time\054 feel free to let us know\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 7110 0 R
     /Pg 4610 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

7110 0 obj
  << /K [ 7109 0 R ]
     /P 7117 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 4610 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

7111 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Main Questions \173\17625 minutes\175\n\nCan you describe what your previous job\057industry was before you stepped away from the workforce\054 and how long your career break was for caregiving\077\nWhat are your motivations to start preparing to return back to work at this point in your life\077\nAs you prepare to return to work\054 what do you feel are your greatest strengths\077 Conversely\054 do you experience any internal worries or anxiety regarding your current career gap or readiness\077\nDo you have people or resources in your life that support you as you prepare to return to work\077 What kind of support and how does it help you during\077\nAs you prepare to return to work\054 what are your biggest concerns\057challenges\077 \nCan you walk me through your typical process for searching for a job\054 including what career platforms or resources you use and any frustrations or challenges you experience with them\077\nBeyond the job title and salary\054 what are some factors important to you when deciding whether a job is a good fit for your life right now\077\nCan you walk me through how you arrange caregiving when you need to do something related to your job search \050e\056g\056 interview\054 networking event\054 or training\051\077\nHave you encountered any challenges related to caregiving or childcare during your job search or hiring process\077 If so\054 can you describe a specific experience\077\nIf you could change one thing about the way career platforms support people returning to work after caregiving\054 what would you change\077\n)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 7112 0 R
     /Pg 4610 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

