7234 0 obj
  << /ActualText (After sharing all our D2 design concepts\054 we decided to go with one of our concepts called \215Career Care\216 that is a career\055support extension that can be used on typical job boards\054 such as LinkedIn\054 to provide valuable information parents returning to the workforce would be interested in based on their specific needs \050e\056g\056 part\055time\054 remote options\054 schedule flexibility\054 etc\056\051\056 The extension would help parents quickly determine if a potential opportunity works for them before spending time applying to a role that may not align with their needs\056)
